From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 18:50:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Design: Modernize Nestbau with warm color palette &
 modern UI
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Replace old flat design (Teal/Maroon) with modern food app style
- New color palette: Orange (#FF8C42), Peach (#FFB84D), Green (#A8D5BA)
- Add gradient backgrounds to cards, buttons, and pills
- Enhance shadows and hover effects (250ms transitions)
- Implement dark mode with adjusted color schemes
- Update icons with new gradient colors
- Optimize for touch targets (48x48px minimum)
- Add CSS animations (slide-in, fade-in, spin loader)
- Full responsive design for 375px+ viewports
- Accessibility-first approach (WCAG AA contrast)
- Extract CSS to external file (nestbau-design.css, 620+ lines)
- Create comprehensive DESIGN-GUIDE.md documentation

Changes:
- nestbau-design.css (new): Modern component styles
- index.html: Link external CSS, update theme-color to #FF8C42
- icon.svg: Gradient from orange to peach
- DESIGN-GUIDE.md (new): Complete design system documentation

Features:
✅ Modern gradients & shadows
✅ Smooth animations (150-250ms)
✅ Dark mode support (system/manual toggle)
✅ Touch-optimized UI (48px+ targets)
✅ Accessibility (4.5:1 contrast minimum)
✅ Performance (external CSS, no dependencies)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
